# Freminet Furina Lisa Xianyun. ~20s Rot. Freminet Phys plunge with Superconduct & 15% DEF Shred. Executes 1 Shattering Pressure combo while plunging. Lisa uses hold skill and really needs that Pamber. 50% Collisions. PF > MH on Freminet.

